Implementation of transitive closure:
```lean
partial def transClosure (env : Environment) (seen : NameSet) (todo : List Name) : NameSet :=
  match todo with
  | [] => seen
  | c :: rest =>
    if seen.contains c then transClosure env seen rest
    else
      let seen := seen.insert c
      let more := match env.find? c with
        | some ci => (ci.type.getUsedConstants.toList ++ (ci.value?.map (·.getUsedConstants.toList) |>.getD [])).filter (fun n => !seen.contains n)
        | none => []
      transClosure env seen (more ++ rest)
```
